# exported OCI image tars (make image-export) — large, never commit
apue-*.tar

# Emacs compiled artifacts. The vendored .emacs.d/elpa/*.el SOURCES are committed
# (via `make update-emacs-packages`, which strips these first and force-adds the
# rest); the compiled/machine-specific outputs are not.
*.elc
*.eln
eln-cache/
